'' A static-storage initialiser computed at run time -- a call, a variable, a field, an
'' element, a dereference, an operator or literal over one -- is fbc error 11 over a type
'' no constructor fills -- including through a builtin that evaluates one: iif, cast, cint,
'' str, left, len over a string -- or through one fbc never folds, even over constants: hex, oct,
'' bin, val, peek. Matches fbc on lines 74-125; the accepted() lines and the plain
'' locals are refused by neither.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/static-init-const.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' GOLDEN: expected/static-init-const.out
